      "defaultBranch": "main",
      "readmeText": "LOSOS \u2014 A 6KB reactive framework for building apps on linked data.\n\nNo build step. No dependencies. No VDOM.\n\nLOSOS renders panes \u2014 small ES modules that display and edit JSON-LD data stored at URLs. Changes auto-save via HTTP PUT and live-sync through WebSocket.\n\nArchitecture:\n  LION    1.5 KB   JSON-LD store, index by @id\n  store   1.9 KB   Reactive mutations, auto-save\n  html    2.5 KB   Tagged templates, DOM patching\n\nLicense: MIT",
